    "Selector is test-owned with a fixed known candidate superset.It does not implement production IMAP,total wire-byte limiting or arbitrary malformed-message guarantees.",
    "One consumer observation was read as retained agent output;it is not an independently replayed model A/B or live-mailbox qualification.",
    "Parent aggregate evidence came from the modified pre-commit worktree,not an exact checkout of the later-created commit.Final files are separately bound here;protected CI must test the exact submitted head.",
    "Both tasks.md files changed after independent parser probes;final versions were reread and bound.The four implementation files match the closed-findings observations.",
